      "value": "Euh..... did you check booth.pm? It's one of the biggest VRChat marketplaces. It has a lot small items to decorate your avatar, and you can buy and/or download free avatars.\nNo need to have own market in VRChat. This will make booth.pm more upset. Many creators are already on booth.pm.\nBut i agreed VRChat should tell us more about booth.pm, or we will see this requests because not all know about it.",
