  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I feel like VRChat would be *so* much better if it had three things:\n1) a Marketplace and a way to buy things (not whole avatars). For example, different types of hair, dresses, shirts, hats, or whatever.\n2) \"standard\" body shapes whether set by VRChat or its creators. A body standard would have a certain shape and rigging so that clothing designers could make clothing to sell for it. \n3) a way to wear things ... not just have an avatar. Let us just change clothes not our entire avatars!\nIt would be so much easier for creators to make avatars pieces and for everyone to play around with their looks in world.",
